SQL Injection — Concept
How it works
sql-- Normal query
SELECT * FROM users WHERE username='mani' AND password='pass'

-- Attacker input: admin' --
SELECT * FROM users WHERE username='admin' --' AND password='pass'
-- Everything after -- is commented out
-- Password check is skipped
-- Logged in as admin
Types of SQL Injection
TypeHow it worksUnion-basedUNION SELECT to extract data from other tablesError-basedTrigger SQL errors that reveal dataBlind (Boolean)Ask true/false questions, infer data from responsesTime-based BlindUse SLEEP() to infer data based on response time
The Fix — Parameterized Queries
python# Vulnerable
query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username='" + username + "'"

# Secure
query = "SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = ?"
cursor.execute(query, (username,))

